 * un-translates the admin. A flat key-to-string map passed through the page has no such
 * coupling, and it costs one small object in the HTML.
 *
 * THE FREE BUILD SHIPS NO PREMIUM STRINGS. Each module appends its own through
 * `plugixa_exam_admin_i18n_strings`, so a premium module that is not installed contributes
 * nothing — which matters beyond tidiness: WordPress.org treats premium-only labels in a
